WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.599 --> 00:00:05.259
My name is Sarah Onken and I'm from Seymour
Indiana. I graduated from Trinity Lutheran

00:00:05.259 --> 00:00:10.680
High School in 2012 and now I'm a junior at
Hillsdale College, majoring in Politics and

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:16.059
Mathematics. This spring I'm interning for
the Heritage Foundation center for principles

00:00:16.059 --> 00:00:21.330
and politics in Washington DC through the
Washington Hillsdale Internship Program.The

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:25.890
Washington Hillsdale Internship Program, we
call it WHIP for short, we bring anywhere

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:30.590
between ten to twenty students a semester
out to DC. They take two or three classes

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:35.120
and they intern on the hill, at the Heritage
Foundation, really anywhere they want to.

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:40.829
When we find somebody coming out of college
who has some practical real world experience,

00:00:40.829 --> 00:00:46.120
especially experience that applies to what
we do, it really sets them apart. Washington

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:51.420
is one of those places that kids can learn
a lot and gain a lot just from being hear for

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:55.679
a few moths. And in that since, coming here
and having that interning experience I can

00:00:55.679 --> 00:00:57.959
guarantee will be life changing.

